{
  "_note": [
    "Pizza, added to Jr's existing menu rather than standing up a restaurant",
    "of its own. Modelled on the Hunt Brothers menu in github.com/Tbhanu19/pizza,",
    "which keeps four tables for this -- toppings, pizza_toppings, products,",
    "categories. None is needed here: a topping is a modifier option, a topping",
    "type is a modifier group, a category is an item type, and a specialty",
    "pizza's default toppings are comes_with.",
    "",
    "THE SIZE GROUP IS CALLED 'Pizza size' ON PURPOSE. The importer matches",
    "groups by name and rebuilds which headings offer them, so a group called",
    "'Size' would take over the one the fries and drinks already use and offer",
    "a 14-inch milkshake.",
    "",
    "THE MEAL LISTS EVERY ITEM, pizzas and burgers alike. The importer deletes",
    "a meal's items and rebuilds them from the file, so anything left out here",
    "comes off the menu.",
    "",
    "PRICES ARE INVENTED. That repo seeds every product at base_price 0.0 with",
    "no topping costs, so there were none to copy."
  ],
